WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:04.820
[Sparse Minimalist Piano and Tense Dissonant String Pad Intro]

00:01:04.820 --> 00:01:08.800
The Pea Eye found us at the hotel

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:14.000
The fortress fell, the sanctuary's breached

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:17.800
A frantic call, a bug-out plan

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:21.610
A safe-house just outside her reach

00:01:25.192 --> 00:01:29.895
The convoy rolled, a silent thread

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:40.167
To Bluewater, to hide instead

00:01:45.972 --> 00:01:49.500
Her childhood room, a tiny space

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:54.000
An inaccessible, cramped place

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.800
The doorway is too narrow

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:59.500
I can't get through the bathroom door

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:02.000
I crawl upon the hardwood floor

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:05.500
My spirit feeling bruised and sore

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:09.500
It's a hell of inconvenience

00:02:10.016 --> 00:02:14.500
A fragile, temporary defense

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:17.800
But I am safe here, hiding out

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:20.923
I kill the fear, I kill the doubt

00:02:21.383 --> 00:02:25.000
This is the Bluewater Bunker

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:29.500
And I am here with you

00:02:29.955 --> 00:02:35.856
My "safe person," you'll see me through

00:02:35.856 --> 00:02:57.381
[Repetitive Obsessive Piano Interlude]

00:02:57.381 --> 00:03:00.500
The nights are long, the bed is small

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:03.500
(It's just a pool raft, after all)

00:03:03.548 --> 00:03:06.000
I lie awake, I'm terrified

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:09.500
Of what's to come, with nowhere left to hide

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:12.500
The court is looming, dark and deep

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:16.500
I cannot rest, I cannot sleep

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:20.500
It's a hell of inconvenience

00:03:21.265 --> 00:03:26.000
A fragile, temporary defense

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:29.000
But I am safe here, hiding out

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:32.061
I kill the fear, I kill the doubt

00:03:32.321 --> 00:03:36.500
This is the Bluewater Bunker

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:41.204
And I am here with you

00:03:41.284 --> 00:03:46.746
My "safe person," you'll see me through

00:03:46.746 --> 00:04:06.443
[Single Pulsing Piano Note]

00:04:06.443 --> 00:04:09.000
But in the dark, you take my hand

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:11.500
You're the one who'll understand

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:14.167
You and Aubrie, here with me

00:04:14.307 --> 00:04:16.800
My anchors in this angry sea

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:19.000
The house is small, the fear is real

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:21.911
But your love is what I feel

00:04:24.992 --> 00:04:35.037
Safe... in the Bluewater Bunker. Safe...

00:04:35.037 --> 00:04:56.920
[Sparse Piano Fades Out]
